An [[Afflicted Ritualist]] is an [[undead]] [[ritualist]] corrupted by the malevolent spirit of [[Shiro Tagachi]]. They are always encountered in a group with other [[Afflicted]] and it is essential that they be taken out early in a fight as they can resurrect other Afflicted (including Afflicted [[boss]]es). Alternatively, have [[interrupt]]s ready and always monitor what Afflicted Ritualists in a group are doing.

